Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:57:57 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] quickcontact: add a menu item to copy the contact to the sim
 card

contacts can import from the sim card through SimPhonebookContract, but
there is no way to write an existing contact back to it. add a copy to
sim overflow item that trims the name to the adn byte limit, lets the
user pick a card on dual-sim devices, and writes the primary number.
